        <item>
            <title>0.15.25</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 09:50:58 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>186</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.25</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Screen video now records at a small, space-saving resolution (720p) by default, so recordings stay light on disk. Signed-in users get a new &quot;Record in high resolution&quot; toggle (Settings, under Screen video recording) to capture at the display&#x27;s native resolution, up to 4K. Bitrate scales with the chosen size.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
